/-!
# The chief-section bridge in the odd amalgam branch

These modules construct the actual action on U^g, bound seed displacement,
prove the two-center bound on the component kernel, and construct a chief
section detecting the conjugated F*(K/O2(K)) lift from the original local quotient.
They apply the full known-simple G.6.4 to a moved section. The actual
exceptional-component image excludes every resulting G.6.4 model.

The joint-detection extension completes the last paragraph from the literal
earlier-source premises and an actual odd pair. The parent amalgam proof
supplies odd-pair existence and combines this with its even branch.
Source: Aschbacher--Smith, 11.5.8, printed p.784.
-/
